{{DPS calculator}}

This article is about calculating melee damage output.
Melee damage is affected by the [[Equipment]] used, [[prayer]], [[Temporary skill boost|skill boosts]] and the [[monster]] being attacked.

There are various methods by which players can increase their potential '''[[Melee]] damage'''. The effects of most equipped items can be seen in the [[Equipment Stats|stats window]] (labelled as Stab, Slash, Crush and Melee Strength).

==Calculating your melee damage output==
===Step one: Calculate the ''effective strength level''===
Effective level is affected by your current strength level multiplied by prayers used and skill level boosts.

